      "data": {
        "title": "4. Bridge",
        "body": "Cross-graph authority: an import Bridge consumes a class or resource, an export Bridge offers one. Also the carrier for event subscriptions.\n\nContract lives in `components/GraphEditor/utils/bridgeSettings.js`, `bridgeEventSubscriptions.js`, `eventBridge.js`, `graphNodeContract.js` (`deriveGraphBackedNodeArtifact`), `Nodes/DynamicViewNode.js` (the inline editor), `validators/validateGraphInvariants.js` (class authority), and the many `tests/bridge*.test.js`.\n\n**Built so far:** `primitives/bridge/root.node` exists with all eight sections, written 2026-09-23. It was written BEFORE the Surface and Declaration changes of 2026-09-24 and has not been re-read since. A search finds one mention of `nodeTypes` (the Declaration list that was removed from the model), one of `default-view` and one of `summary-view` (older Declaration relationships), each to be checked in context. Remaining: that re-read, and adding the Custom Declaration class import (`templates/declaration-template/example`) as an example.\n\nReview rule: separate semantic meaning from representation, and agreed behavior from implemented evidence and known gaps.",
        "status": "done",
        "owner": "",
        "priority": "high",
        "estimateHours": "",
        "acceptanceCriteria": [
          "Every statement matches bridgeSettings.js and the validator",
          "No mention of a removed or changed Declaration field remains",
          "The Examples node links real graphs, including the Custom Declaration import"
        ],
