        "title": "13. Method",
        "body": "Runnable behavior with declared effects: what a Handler invokes. The Page Template's \"Assemble the page\" is one.\n\nContract lives in `Nodes/MethodNode.js`, `hooks/usePluginRuntime.js` (the script API: getNodes, updateView, and so on, and its mutation rules), `tests/methodEffects.test.js`, `methodEffectsHost.test.js`, and the `invokes` edge class.\n\nWatch for: declared `effects` (which nodes it may write) and how they are enforced; question 4 asks how Method and Script relate.\n\nReview rule: separate semantic meaning from representation, and agreed behavior from implemented evidence and known gaps.",
