        "title": "14. Script",
        "body": "Advanced. Executable source attached to a graph. Never starter structure (AGENTS.md).\n\nContract lives in `Nodes/ScriptNode.js`, `components/GraphEditor/Scripting/`, `components/GraphEditor/Scripting/scriptRefLoader.js`, `tests/scriptRefLoader.test.js`, `scriptSourceTransport.test.js`, `bridgeScriptPlacement.test.js`.\n\nWatch for: a raw Script is authoring infrastructure and hidden in browse mode unless it is class-backed and explicitly browser-presented (`nodeVisibilityRoles.js`). Say what a script may do and what it may not.\n\nReview rule: separate semantic meaning from representation, and agreed behavior from implemented evidence and known gaps.",
