        "body": "Goal: Every concept needed to explain Twilite has one canonical specification, separating meaning, representation and implementation evidence\nStatus: done\n\nTasks in scope:\n1. 1. Specify the eight-section form and evidence policy\n2. 2. Restore Declaration Behavior and reconcile evidence\n3. 3. Reconcile Surface meaning and the View/Glyph boundary\n4. 4. Bridge\n\nOpen questions:\n1. 1. Is Surface a primitive, or a concept that lives beside them?\n2. 2. Are Edge, Event Handler, Method and Membrane primitives?\n3. 3. Are Property, Node Class, Template, Collection, Workspace and Minimap primitives?\n4. 4. How do Method and Script relate?",
